 "Break it into small steps": "Dividirla en pasos pequeños",
 "It needs {length}, and the meal is sooner than that.": "Necesita {length}, y la comida es antes de eso.",
 "It needs {length}. Best started by {when}.": "Necesita {length}. Lo mejor es empezar antes de {when}.",
 "It needs {length}. Start by {when}.": "Necesita {length}. Empieza antes de {when}.",
 "Tomorrow: {list}.": "Mañana: {list}.",
 "Pick or type the dish first.": "Primero elige el platillo o escribe su nombre.",
